W170 changes ONLY the Windows upload path:
- Existing authenticated multipart POST /api/v1/uploads is retained.
- MP3 duration preflight now recognizes the bounded metadata variants accepted by the browser extension and shared server cleaner.
- Local inspection never rewrites or transcodes the selected file; original bytes are sent to the shared server unchanged.
- Require HTTP 202, status=pending and a positive replacement_id before displaying upload success.
- Map invalid_mp3, invalid_m4a, upload_too_large and missing server confirmation to clear user messages.
- Preserve 30 MiB size limit, 1.5-second duration tolerance, rights declaration, request_id deduplication and in-flight submit guard.
- Full MP3 decoding and authoritative cleanup remain server-side. Server already deployed; DO NOT redeploy it.

No changes to playback, volume, Next/Previous, radio, audio routing, native Yandex host, Android, access, billing or moderation.
No server files, server deployment, signing, production feed or release.

Expected output:
- CELIKOM-W170-WINDOWS-UPLOAD-CLEANUP-02452-UNSIGNED.exe
- CELIKOM-Windows-0.24.52.zip
- SHA256SUMS.txt

